  "title": "Renasant Corporation Declares Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "TUPELO, Miss., Aug. 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- The board of directors of Renasant Corporation (NYSE: RNST) approved the payment of a quarterly cash dividend of twenty-four cents ($0.24) per share to be paid September 30, 2026, to shareholders of record as of September 16, 2026.",
